# Telethon user session for scripts/telegram_ingest.py. Already covered by the
# data/ rule above; listed explicitly because this file IS a live credential —
# anyone holding it can read Telegram as you, with no password or 2FA prompt.
# It must never be committed, even if data/ is ever un-ignored.
*.session
*.session-journal
data/tg_ingest.session
